message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "LaserLab: Interactive Laser Physics Simulator"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-06
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/SEU-USUARIO/laserlab"
url: "https://SEU-USUARIO.github.io/laserlab/"
abstract: "Educational, browser-based simulator of a four-level laser. It integrates the population and photon rate equations (RK4) and visualizes energy levels, population inversion, spontaneous and stimulated emission, optical gain, laser threshold and the optical resonator."
keywords:
  - laser physics
  - rate equations
  - population inversion
  - physics education
  - interactive simulation
